| `eval-report` | **Mandatory before Done** when any trigger fired this session |

## Routing

After analyze, route from acceptance criteria (or discovery output):

| AC shape | Plan | Delegate | Run |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| API endpoint only (no page in AC) | `api-contract-tests` from spec or catalog | **api-test-writer** | `npx playwright test --project=api` |
| Page flow | Gherkin saved to `features/<key>.feature.md` or `features/explore-<slug>.feature.md` | **test-writer** | UI suite (as today) |
| Both | API plan first, then page plan | **api-test-writer** then **test-writer** | API project, then UI suite |

**With ticket:** `jira-ticket-analyzer` → route per table → run → if red, **Heal on red**.

**No ticket:** `explore-and-generate` → route per table (page plan path uses `features/explore-<slug>.feature.md`).

